From e0f716008ee794a521b9b80d9839ef4f7d255dbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iwan-uschka <iwan@creativytool.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add negative XPC peer-rejection test for RenderService

Extracts the peer-trust check out of main.swift (which has top-level
executable statements and can't link into a test target) into
PeerTrust.swift, and adds PeerTrustTests: a real, separately ad-hoc
signed process spawned outside the fixture app-bundle root and
asserted to be refused, alongside the positive case of a peer inside
the root. Closes #11.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
